        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2023-08-01_at_6.58.38_AM.png",
        "description": "The cowboy boot is back on the fashion-map—thanks to the sister duo behind @mironcrosby. The wishlist-worthy Western designs are inspired by their Texan ranching roots, as the flora, fauna and star-studded embroidery is an ode to the fifth-generation farm where they were raised. From metallic monogram stitching to a painted toe, the zing will make you say “yeehaw!” In Nancy Sinatra-fashion, these boots are made for walkin’ whether that around a cattle ranch or a cocktail party, as they embody the perfect confluence of high fashion and cowboy flair. In Nancy Sinatra-fashion, we give you the Top Tens of the girls creating the boots made for walkin’—from cattle ranch to cocktail party…",
